\"My grandmother counted the bells with me when I was small\"},\n{\"text\": \"The narrator and grandmother found six bells in the tower above the village.\", \"line\": 5, \"span\": \"we found six of them in the tower above the village\"},\n{\"text\": \"All six bells were cast in 1782.\", \"line\": 7, \"span\": \"All six were cast in 1782\"},\n{\"text\": \"The bells were cast by a founder who put his mark on the tenor alone.\", \"line\": 7, \"span\": \"by a founder who put his mark on the tenor alone\"},\n{\"text\": \"The founder cut the year 1782 into the tenor.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"The founder cut the year 1782 into the tenor\"},\n{\"text\": \"The tenor was the only bell the founder signed.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"that was the only bell he signed\"},\n{\"text\": \"A full peal needs eight ringers.\", \"line\": 11, \"span\": \"A full peal needs eight ringers\"},\n{\"text\": \"The band could never attempt a full peal while a single ringer was missing.\", \"line\": 11, \"span\": \"so the band could never attempt one while a single ringer was missing\"},\n{\"text\": \"The band could not attempt a full peal with fewer than eight ringers.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"We could not attempt a full peal with fewer than eight ringers\"},\n{\"text\": \"One absence was enough to call the whole peal attempt off.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"one absence was enough to call the whole thing off\"},\n{\"text\": \"A full peal runs for two hours once the ringing starts.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"Once the ringing starts a full peal runs for two hours\"},\n{\"text\": \"The band works through the full peal without a break.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"the band works through it without a break\"},\n{\"text\": \"A full peal took two hours from the first stroke to the last.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"From the first stroke to the last a full peal took two hours\"},\n{\"text\": \"Nobody left the ringing chamber in between the first stroke and the last during a full peal.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"nobody left the ringing chamber in between\"},\n{\"text\": \"The bells are rung on the first Sunday of every month.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"The bells are rung on the first Sunday of every month\"},\n{\"text\": \"The village has always kept the hour by the bells.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"the village has always kept the hour by them\"},\n{\"text\": \"The narrator and others rang on the first Sunday of the month, every month.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"We rang on the first Sunday of the month, every month\"},\n{\"text\": \"People in the village knew the hour from the sound of the bells.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"people in the village knew the hour from the sound\"}\n]}","ttft_ms":9235,"type":"result","duration_ms":9271,"uuid":"a1bc52d5-34b1-4a57-abfd-d84db932f20f","ttft_stream_ms":2798,"time_to_request_ms":121,"first_content_frame_ms":2798,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
